OL,3,GNEWSADales wind farm would 'spoil'
OL,4,Aview, says former PM
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer Prime Minister Rishi Sunak has
OL,7,Fspoken out against plans for 23 wind
OL,8,Fturbines to be built on moorland on the
OL,9,Fedge of his constituency.
OL,11,FThe Conservative MP for Richmond and
OL,12,FNorthallerton met with Dr Sam
OL,13,FRushworth, the Labour MP for Bishop
OL,14,FAuckland, whose constituency also
OL,15,Fincludes the Hope Moor site.
OL,17,FThe 200m (656ft) structures would have
OL,18,Fa "very obvious" visual impact for
OL,19,FSwaledale and Wensleydale and lead to
OL,20,Fviews being "spoilt", Sunak said.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
